      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · How we work"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · What it is"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Kaboo: token analysis"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "An open-source project inside ByteDance. How it was made matters more than what it does."
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**What it does**\nAnalyzes token consumption: where agents spend their tokens."
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**How it was made**\nWith a new way of working together, where one person carries a change from problem to production."
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "No relay: one owner, end to end"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "Whoever raises a problem takes it all the way to production."
    },
    {
      "id": "rl",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 230,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Not the usual relay**\nRequirement → schedule → build → test → release, handed between people."
    },
    {
      "id": "o1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 738,
      "y": 166,
      "w": 92,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "**Raise**"
    },
    {
      "id": "o2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 852,
      "y": 166,
      "w": 92,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "**Solve**"
    },
    {
      "id": "o3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 966,
      "y": 166,
      "w": 92,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "**Test**"
    },
    {
      "id": "o4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 166,
      "w": 92,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "**Ship**"
    },
    {
      "id": "one",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 738,
      "y": 254,
      "w": 434,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "All four by the same person, who owns that part."
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 326,
      "w": 340,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Safeguard 1 · before release**\nan agent checks the change for problems"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 832,
      "y": 326,
      "w": 340,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Safeguard 2 · after release**\na fast rollback if something goes wrong"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "The road is paved: mew, inside Lark"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A project-management platform that builds agents into the software-development process."
    },
    {
      "id": "w1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**An idea**\nstated clearly"
    },
    {
      "id": "w2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**mew**\nagents built into the development process"
    },
    {
      "id": "w3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1852,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**Built and shipped**\nby the person who had the idea"
    },
    {
      "id": "w4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Connected to Lark**\nwhere the team already talks and works."
    },
    {
      "id": "w5",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**The one requirement**\nBeing able to say clearly what you want."
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1156,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "The Token Efficiency Leaderboard, end to end"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1156,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "I raised the problem, designed the fix, tested it and shipped it."
    },
    {
      "id": "bs",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 700,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 300,
      "text": "**The blind spot**\nEveryone looked at where agents failed.\n\nNobody looked at tasks that succeeded, but wasted a lot of tokens getting there."
    },
    {
      "id": "f1x",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 700,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**5 kinds of waste**\neach with a criterion for spotting it"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2x",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 805,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**Metadata only**\nthe diagnosis never reads session content"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3x",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 364,
      "y": 910,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**Effective Tokens**\none cost scale across different models"
    },
    {
      "id": "sh",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 790,
      "w": 236,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Tested and shipped, by me**\nthe leaderboard and the efficiency-analysis module"
    },
    {
      "id": "res",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 984,
      "y": 795,
      "w": 200,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**10K+**\ninternal users covered"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 792,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "Judgment becomes the bottleneck"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 792,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "What this changed about how I see collaboration in the AI era."
    },
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 710,
      "w": 238,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**Implementation gets cheap**\nthe infrastructure flattens its cost"
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1570,
      "y": 710,
      "w": 238,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**The bottleneck moves**\nto thinking a problem through and saying it clearly"
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 710,
      "w": 238,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**So does the value**\nfrom execution to judgment"
    },
    {
      "id": "lq",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 870,
      "w": 778,
      "h": 80,
      "text": "**A person's value lies more in judgment than in execution.**"
    }
  ],
